{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>For every man, whoever curses.</b> And this is a sign of how greatly I insist that holiness reside in the offspring, for I have punished with a court death one who curses his parents — for this will occur among the majority when there is a defect in the offspring, since he is then unfit for what is written: שְׁמַע בְּנִי מוּסַר אָבִיךָ (Proverbs 1:8). Such a man will not keep statutes and ordinances, for he will not receive them from his father and his mother at all."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:06.480974369Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}